# Personal files and local planning. Nothing personal belongs in a public repo,
# so this is also a safety net: one `git add -A` must not publish either of these.
# The session file is a one-line Copilot resume handle; it was named resume.md
# until the docs truth pass, which invited a reader to file it as CV content.
resume.md
copilot-session.txt
odd/
